  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the artful ambience of Estúdio Bloom Ink, where master tattooist Alex Mceye brings your skin to life with stunning realism. Nestled in the vibrant heart of Guarujá, Brazil, at Rua Quintino Bocaiuva, 521 - sala 11, this haven for ink enthusiasts specializes in both black and white and colorful, delicate designs that capture your deepest imaginations. Join the canvas of refined expression and let Alex's expert hand craft an enduring masterpiece just for you.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Guarujá, Sao Paulo, Brazil",
